        <span begin="03:35.552" end="03:44.096">I </span>
        <span begin="03:44.096" end="03:52.640">was </span>
        <span begin="03:52.640" end="04:01.184">lost </span>
        <span begin="04:01.184" end="04:09.730">.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
